s namespace is not run (lane loop-prove, 86b7cdbbe, 2026-10-10): its check answers \"The admitted identity has no executable test Var.\" and leaves a recurring acquisition-refusal error on every later request. A `def` is not program, so the test's reached definitions do not carry it. Done when such a test either runs with the def available in the context or is refused once, at the form that defines it, naming the def and the fix, with no recurring error."
